<title>USA: Chess-Moves in Game Five of Kasparov vs. Deep Blue.</title>
<headline>Chess-Moves in Game Five of Kasparov vs. Deep Blue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the moves in Saturday's fifth game of the $1.1 million six-game re-match between world chess champion Garry Kasparov and the IBM supercomputer Deep Blue.</p>
<p>King's Indian Attack</p>
<p>    Kasparov (white)   Deep Blue (black)</p>
<p>    1.  Nf3		d5</p>
<p>    2.  g3		 Bg4</p>
<p>    3.  Bg2		Nd7</p>
<p>    4.  h3		 Bxf3</p>
<p>    5.  Bxf3	     c6</p>
<p>    6.  d3		 e6</p>
<p>    7.  e4		 Ne5</p>
<p>    8.  Bg2		dxe4</p>
<p>    9.  Bxe4	     Nf6</p>
<p>    10. Bg2		Bb4+</p>
<p>    11. Nd2		h5</p>
<p>    12. Qe2		Qc7</p>
<p>    13. c3		 Be7</p>
<p>    14. d4		 Ng6</p>
<p>    15. h4		 e5</p>
<p>    16. Nf3		exd4</p>
<p>    17. Nxd4	     O-O-O</p>
<p>    18. Bg5		Ng4</p>
<p>    19. O-O-O	    Rhe8</p>
<p>    20. Qc2		Kb8</p>
<p>    21. Kb1		Bxg5</p>
<p>    22. hxg5	     N6e5</p>
<p>    23. Rhe1	     c5</p>
<p>    24. Nf3		Rxd1+</p>
<p>    25. Rxd1	     Nc4</p>
<p>    26. Qa4		Rd8</p>
<p>    27. Re1		Nb6</p>
<p>    28. Qc2		Qd6</p>
<p>    29. c4		 Qg6</p>
<p>    30. Qxg6	     fxg6</p>
<p>    31. b3		 Nxf2</p>
<p>    32. Re6		Kc7</p>
<p>    33. Rxg6	     Rd7</p>
<p>    34. Nh4		Nc8</p>
<p>    35. Bd5		Nd6</p>
<p>    36. Re6		Nb5</p>
<p>    37. cxb5	     Rxd5</p>
<p>    38. Rg6		Rd7</p>
<p>    39. Nf5		Ne4</p>
<p>    40. Nxg7	     Rd1+</p>
<p>    41. Kc2		Rd2+</p>
<p>    42. Kc1		Rxa2</p>
<p>    43. Nxh5	     Nd2</p>
<p>    44. Nf4		Nxb3+</p>
<p>    45. Kb1		Rd2</p>
<p>    46. Re6		c4</p>
<p>    47. Re3		Kb6</p>
<p>    48. g6		 Kxb5</p>
<p>    49. g7		 Kb4</p>
<p>Draw agreed 1/2-1/2</p>
</text>
